From 887d8ac3e8486d85f18bba46bd231ff34e399276 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:33:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(studio): drain Agency Fast hours, then Usage

Agency is not uncapped. The sidebar meter runs 90 Fast hours down to
zero while generating, then shows an amber Usage tag. Generate keeps
running. Fast seconds are written when a job finishes so Live usage
matches the bar.
